#: 80a060a79fe949959e4cb992d0a08b89
msgid "Avionics Anonymous Magnetometer"
msgstr "Avionics Anonymous 磁力计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-mag.rst:7 d57f5857f40749cc81bd3530162521e8
msgid ""
"The `Avionics Anonymous Magnetometer "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/minimag>`__ is a high-"
"performance magnetometer for small unmanned vehicles. It includes a high-"
"quality Memsic MMC5983MA magnetometer enabling better than 1-degree heading "
"accuracy. The device interfaces to your autopilot via a robust `DroneCAN "
"<https://dronecan.org>`__ interface, which provides high reliability "
"connections to peripherals over greater distances than I2C."
msgstr ""
"`Avionics Anonymous 磁力计 "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/minimag>`__ "
"是一款用于小型无人机的高性能磁力计，内置高品质 Memsic MMC5983MA 磁力计，航向精度优于 1 度。设备通过稳健的 `DroneCAN "
"<https://dronecan.org>`__ 接口与飞控通信，比 I2C 提供更高可靠性和更远连接距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-mag.rst:17 4d2b6a2d33cf429ea0d0f6ac7b973818
msgid ""
"The following parameter should be set on the autopilot (and then reboot the "
"autopilot):"
msgstr "应在飞控上设置以下参数（然后重启飞控）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-mag.rst:19 54bb9523712340edbbb5041ef2bb6848
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (to enable the 1st CAN port)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（启用第一路 CAN 端口）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-mag.rst:21 43869bc757f64acda6dd28812d473088
msgid ""
"If the device does not work please follow the instructions on enabling the "
"CANBUS in the :ref:`common-canbus-setup-advanced` page, followed by "
":ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` steps."
msgstr ""
"如果设备无法工作，请按照 :ref:`common-canbus-setup-advanced` 页面上的 CANBUS 启用说明操作，然后执行 "
":ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` 步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-mag.rst:23 704f43454ca94f0796a284dfd3627099
msgid ""
"The `manufacturer's product page is here "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/minimag>`__ for general "
"information about the device."
msgstr ""
"有关设备的一般信息，请访问 `制造商产品页面 "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/minimag>`__。"
